            is the (even, for now) integer that gets promoted to the eponymous
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/matrix"} matrix
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
