          %p
            it follows that for
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/spin+Chern-Simons+theory"} spin Chern-Simons theory
            one may allow also half-integral level
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
