          %p Some of the following sections stick to one or the other of these conventions.
          %h3#the_equation_of_motion The equation of motion
          %p
            The
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Euler-Lagrange+equation"} Euler-Lagrange
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/equation+of+motion"} equation of motion
            associated with the abelian Chern-Simons Lagrangian
            %a.maruku-eqref{:href => "#eq:TheLagrangianDensity"} (2)
            is immediately found to be
          .maruku-equation
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi F
