            follows the transformation rules of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Gaussian+integrals"} Gaussian integrals
            over elements
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi ϕ
                  %mo ∈
                  %msup
                    %mi ℝ
                    %mi n
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \phi \in \mathbb{R}^n
            of finite-dimensional
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Cartesian+spaces"} Cartesian spaces
