          %p
            whereby the
            %em
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Chern-Simons+propagator"} Chern-Simons propagator
            – namely the analog of
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %msup
                    %mi M
                    %mrow
