          %h4#AbelianCSWIlsonLoopsTheRenormalizationChoice The renormalization choice
          %p
            %a{:href => "#Polyakov88"} Polyakov 1988 (5)
            considered one regularization of
            = succeed "." do
              %a.maruku-eqref{:href => "#eq:AbelianCSPropagatorForComputationOfWilsonLoops"} (11)
