              %a{:href => "#HierarchicalKMatrixFormalism"} HH-hierarchy
              underlying this K-matrix formulation, when applied to ordinary single-component
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/FQH+systems"} FQH systems
